Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
Things I\[CloseCurlyQuote]ve done:

- generalized old code to arbitrary 2-color, 2-radius, symmetric, quiescent, \
max-growth-rate-1 rules
- Made a heuristic Class-4 detector to find nice rules

- Significant progress on new code for packed arbitrary color, arbitrary \
radius, quiescent rules
- Worked on Boolean Minimization including Exact Synthesis
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.991902078155571*^9, 3.991902188126925*^9}, {
  3.991902280503981*^9, 
  3.991902347473467*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"17d20d42-60df-4ec0-b73b-\
aa12fb905ac9"],

